flowchart TD
  Change[Pull request or push] --> Install[npm ci]
  Install --> TypeCheck[npx tsc --noEmit]
  TypeCheck --> Build[npm run build]
  Build --> Review[Review workflow result]
  Review -->|Pass| Manual[Manual route smoke test]
  Review -->|Fail| Fix[Diagnose and fix]
  Fix --> Change
  Manual -->|Verified| Release[Deploy Next.js UI build]
  Manual -->|Not verified| FollowUp[Record gap, do not claim full QA]
  Release --> Routes[Verify / and /editor]
